// --- 거래내역 보고서 인쇄 모달 (감사 및 가족 정보공시용) ---
const PrintReportModal = ({ isOpen, onClose, transactions, accounts, getAccountById, dateRange, searchTerm }) => {
  if (!isOpen) return null;

  useEffect(() => {
    if (window.lucide) window.lucide.createIcons();
  });

  useEffect(() => {
    document.body.classList.add('print-modal-active');
    return () => {
      document.body.classList.remove('print-modal-active');
    };
  }, []);

  const filteredTxs = useMemo(() => {
    return transactions.filter(t => {
      const matchStart = !dateRange.start || t.date >= dateRange.start;
      const matchEnd = !dateRange.end || t.date <= dateRange.end;
      if (!matchStart || !matchEnd) return false;
      if (!searchTerm) return true;
      const term = searchTerm.toLowerCase();
      const vMatch = (t.vendor || '').toLowerCase().includes(term);
      const mMatch = (t.memo || '').toLowerCase().includes(term);
      const dMatch = t.debits.some(d => (getAccountById(d.accountId)?.name || '').toLowerCase().includes(term));
      const cMatch = t.credits.some(c => (getAccountById(c.accountId)?.name || '').toLowerCase().includes(term));
      return vMatch || mMatch || dMatch || cMatch;
    }).sort((a, b) => a.date.localeCompare(b.date));
  }, [transactions, dateRange, searchTerm, getAccountById]);

  const totalDebits = useMemo(() => {
    return filteredTxs.reduce((sum, t) => sum + (t.debits || []).reduce((s, d) => s + Number(d.amount || 0), 0), 0);
  }, [filteredTxs]);

  const totalCredits = useMemo(() => {
    return filteredTxs.reduce((sum, t) => sum + (t.credits || []).reduce((s, c) => s + Number(c.amount || 0), 0), 0);
  }, [filteredTxs]);

  const isBalanced = totalDebits === totalCredits;

  const nowStr = useMemo(() => {
    const d = new Date();
    const pad = (n) => String(n).padStart(2, '0');
    return `${d.getFullYear()}-${pad(d.getMonth() + 1)}-${pad(d.getDate())} ${pad(d.getHours())}:${pad(d.getMinutes())}:${pad(d.getSeconds())}`;
  }, []);

  const handlePrint = () => {
    window.print();
  };

  return html`
    <div className="fixed inset-0 z-[150] flex items-center justify-center bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-2 sm:p-4 print-modal-container">
